2 CONT (--?--) Olufsdtr Tengs was born at Tengs 1d, Eigersund, Rogaland, Norway. She married Sven Torgersen Årstad, son of Torger Bergesen Årstad and (--?--) Svensdtr. She died at Slettebø 2, Eigersund, Rogaland, Norway. She is mentioned
2 CONC  Nes.275.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sven Torgersen Årstad married (--?--) Olufsdtr Tengs, daughter of Oluf Gunbjørnsen Tengs. He was born in 1470 at Årstad 3b, Eigersund, Rogaland, Norway. He is mentioned Nes.275.
2 CONT
2 CONT A letter from the Bishop of Stavanger to King Kristian III regarding tax income states that a plague had caused many fatalities in the area in 1521, it seems both her husband and brother died of this plague, it is possible that sh
2 CONC e also died from this plague in 1521.
