2 CONT Torborg Pedersdtr Skoland was born at Skoland, Lyngdal, Vest Agder, Norway. She married Gamel Olsen Austad, son of Oluf (--?--) Austad. She is mentioned Kvinesdal I.393.lyngdal II.140.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gamel Olsen Austad was born at Austad, Austad, Vest Agder, Norway. He married Torborg Pedersdtr Skoland, daughter of Peder Reidulvsen Mandal and (--?--) Aresdtr Fidja. He died after 1591 at Skoland, Lyngdal, Vest Agder, Norway. He
2 CONC  is mentioned Kvinesdal I.393.Lyngdal II.140.Austad II.180.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
