2 CONT Brynjulf had served for 5 years for lens (fief) Lord Stig Bagge. Stig Bakgge paid off the debt against the farm at Loga for Brynjulf from Bishop Hoskuld i Stavanger. 
2 CONT P.Seland: Rafoss i Kvinesdal, s. 33-63 i Arsskrift for Agder Historielag nr 42 (1964) 
2 CONT Brynjulf var antagelig en slektning av Stig Bagge. 
