1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * [https://www.nb.no/items/d5787b4ce01ed024c77043f5a4c11980?page=183 "Austad: Gard og folk, Bind 2 (Lyngdal VI)" (Austad, Gardsnr. 48, Eiere og brukere av Austad, Stenu (Stener) Bjørnsen Austad, pp. 180-181)]
2 CONT * [https://www.nb.no/items/931a4ffb452f6a2306de08a17b4d6987?page=261 "Lunds historie: Gårdens og slektens liv", Bind 1 (G. nr. 12, Skår, Br. nr. 1 - Skår, XI. Stenu Bjørnsen Austad, p. 260)]
2 CONT * [https://www.nb.no/items/db704f9e9a6bb05f4ca355894f075bd7?page=396  "Kvinesdal: ei bygdebok. Gards- og ættesoga", Bind 1 (Øvre Egeland, Dei næraste eterkomarane etter Toralde Bergulvson, p. 393)]
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Reference: Book
2 CONT
2 CONT Kvås 49.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lyngdal II.140.
2 CONT
2 CONT Torborg Gamelsdtr Skoland died at Vatland, Kvås, Vest Agder, Norway. She was born circa 1570 at Skoland, Lyngdal, Vest Agder, Norway. She married Stenu Bjørnsen Vatland, son of Bjørn Stenussen Vatland and Audbjørg Olufsdtr Austad,
2 CONC  circa 1585. She is mentioned Austad II.180, Kvinesdal I. 393. Lyngdal II.140.
2 CONT
2 CONT Stenu Bjørnsen Vatland was born at Vatlan, Kvås, Vest Agder, Norway. He married Torborg Gamelsdtr Skoland, daughter of Gamel Olsen Austad and Torborg Pedersdtr Skoland, circa 1585. He lived in 1591 at Austad, Austad, Vest Agder, N
2 CONC orway. He died in 1622 at Vatlan, Kvås, Vest Agder, Norway. He nevnt Kvås 49. Kvinesdal.I. 393. Lund 260.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Reference: Book
2 CONT
2 CONT Austad II.31.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lyngdal II.97.
2 CONT
2 CONT Knut Grimsen Ås was born at Ås, Austad, Vest Agder, Norway. He married Anne Torgersdtr Sande, daughter of Torgeir Salvesen Lyngsvåg and Birgitte (--?--). He married (--?--) Stenusdtr Austad, daughter of Stenu Bjørnsen Vatland and 
2 CONC Torborg Gamelsdtr Skoland. He died after 1629 at Sådland, Lyngdal, Vest Agder, Norway. He nevnt Austad II.31.Lyngdal II.97. 
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT <p>Lund, Skår 260.XI. Ætt&Heim 1956 s.110.</p><p>Datter av Gamel Olufson og Torborg Pedersdtr. Skaland i Lyngdal. Gift med Stenu Bjørnson Austad, Lyngdal.</p>
