2 CONT Odd Brynjulfsen Loga was born at Loga, Nes, Vest Agder, Norway. He married Asbjørg Torkelsdtr Sæveland. He died before 1601 at Sæveland, Herad, Vest Agder, Norway. He is mentioned Herad, 512-.
2 CONT
2 CONT Asbjørg Torkelsdtr Sæveland was born at Sæveland, Herad, Vest Agder, Norway. She married Odd Brynjulfsen Loga, son of Brynjulf Oddsen Feda and Ragni Stålesdtr Flikka. She died before 1634 at Loga Br.1. II., Nes, Vest Agder, Norway
2 CONC . She is mentioned Nes I.496.Herad 511.
2 CONT
