2 CONT Bjørn Stålesen Møskeland was born at Møskeland, Lyngdal, Vest Agder, Norway. He married Adlu Øyusdtr Kvelland, daughter of Øyu Amundsen Kvelland and Åse Bergesdtr Berge. He died before 29 Jun 1635 at Kvelland, Lyngdal, Vest Agder,
2 CONC  Norway. He nevnt
2 CONT
2 CONT Lyngdal II.246,419.
2 CONT
2 CONT Adlu Øyusdtr Kvelland married Bjørn Stålesen Møskeland, son of Ståle Carlsen Møskeland. She was born circa 1580 at Kvelland, Lyngdal, Vest Agder, Norway. She died before 29 Jun 1635 at Kvelland, Lyngdal, Vest Agder, Norway. She ne
2 CONC vnt Lyngdal II.246.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Lyngdal-II , Bbk. , Kvelland  p.246
