1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Gro Sigurdsdatter b. c 1585, d. b 1659 Pop-up Pedigree Appears on charts: Pedigree for John Petter Langeland
2 CONT
2 CONT Gro Sigurdsdatter was the daughter of Sigurd Bendikson Lisletog. Gro Sigurdsdatter was born circa 1585 at Lisletog, Fyresdal, TM.1 She married Halvor Olavson Moghus, son of Olav Halvorsen Moghus and Tone Olavsdatter, in 1606 at Mo
2 CONC ghus, Fyresdal, TM.1 Gro Sigurdsdatter died before 1659 at Moghus, Fyresdal, TM.2
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Gro Sigurdsdatter and Halvor Olavson Moghus: Åshild Halvorsdatter Moghus+ (1609)
2 CONT
2 CONT [S10] Unknown author, Mormonerne. [S45] Unknown author, Per Holte Rosenkilde.
