2 CONT Anna d.e. Torkelsdtr Drange  married Torkel Olsen Gjemlestad, son of Ole Torkelsen Gjemlestad. Her married name was Gjemlestad. She was born at Drange, Herad, Vest Agder, Norway. She died in 1706 at Gjemlestad, Kvinesdal, Vest Agd
2 CONC er, Norway. She left a will on 23 Jun 1706 at Gjemlestad.
