2 CONT !DEATH:FamilySearch (http://new.familysearch.org), "FamilySearch," database, \i FamilySearch\i0 �, The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints, (http://new.familysearch.org), accessed 23 Nov 2015), entry for Knut Jonsen, perso
