2 CONT 2036. Olav* GUDMUNDSSON Håland(774) (775)(767) was born in 1654 in Ile gård #31, Vikedal, Rogaland, Norway. He Census Info Olle Gudmundsen; 50yo in 1701 in Håland gård #68, Erfjord, Rogaland, Norway. He died in Jan 1720/21 in Håla
2 CONC nd gård #68, Erfjord, Rogaland, Norway. He was buried on 12 Jan 1720/21 in Erfjord, Rogaland, Norway. He had an estate probated on 18 Mar 1720/21 in Håland gård #68, Erfjord, Rogaland, Norway. Olav Gudmundsson owned and farmed all
2 CONC  of Håland (3 laupar smør). He also owned parts of several other farms and his total land holdings amounted to about 7 laupar smør. Since he lived at Håland, which was exempt from taxes as the lensmann's residence, he must have be
2 CONC en the local lensmann. He was married to Sissel* BØRGESDATTER Aubø in 1678 in Ryfylke, Rogaland, Norway. (774)
2 CONT
2 CONT 2037. Sissel* BØRGESDATTER Aubø(776) (774) (767) was born in 1645 in Aubø gård #20, Sjernarøy, Rogaland, Norway. She died in 1706 in Håland gård #68, Erfjord, Rogaland, Norway. Children were:  i. Marita OLAVSDATTER Håland was born
2 CONC  about 1678 in Håland gård #68, Erfjord, Rogaland, Norway.  ii. Brynhild OLAVSDATTER Håland(777) (774)(767) was born about 1680 in Håland gård #68, Erfjord, Rogaland, Norway. She died about 1734 in Augland gård #8, Hjelmeland, Rog
2 CONC aland, Norway. She had an estate probated on 8 Jun 1734 in Hjelmeland, Rogaland, Norway.  iii. Berit OLAVSDATTER Hauge was born about 1681 in Håland gård #68, Erfjord, Rogaland, Norway. She died about 1714 in Hjelmeland, Rogaland,
2 CONC  Norway. At Nedre Hauge.  iv. Sissel OLAVSDATTER was born about 1683 in Håland gård #68, Erfjord, Rogaland, Norway.  v. Liva OLAVSDATTER was born about 1685 in Håland gård #68, Erfjord, Rogaland, Norway. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1018 vi. Gudmund* OLAVSEN Håland.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT "Ola Gudmundson Håland fekk utlagt det meste av Håland i samband med arveoppgjeret etter far og farfar i 1677/1678." (Erfjord: Gardar og folk 2. s. 1047.)
2 CONT Sissel Børgesdatter  døde 1706, og Ola levde som enkemann på gården frem til sin død i 1720. (Erfjord: Gardar og folk 2. s. 1009-1012 og 1047.)
