1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Skåneviksoga II page 160 Alsåker (12n), page 146 Fatland (12).
2 CONT
2 CONT To America 1877.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/46326603/siri-fatland
2 CONT
2 CONT Siri “Sara” Torsdatter Fatland BIRTH	2 Jun 1828 Hordaland fylke, Norway DEATH	14 Mar 1897 (aged 68) Helmar, Kendall County, Illinois, USA BURIAL	 Helmar Lutheran Cemetery Newark, Kendall County, Illinois, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Siri, daughter of Tor Eriksen & Mangela Nelsdatter, was born on the Alsager (var: Alsaker)Farm located in Skanevik, Norway. In 1851, she married Thor Nielsen of Fatland Farm. Together they had 8 children. In 1877, Thor, Siri, and 
2 CONC 6 of their children immigrated to the USA. The 2 eldest sons, Thor & Niels (Nels) preceded them in crossing in 1874. They assumed the surname of their farm, Fatland, after immigrating and settled in the counties of Kendall, Dupage
2 CONC , and Grundy, IL.
2 CONT
